          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>The main KPI view metrics, when expressed in percentage, are calculated against matched vendors. Glossary: </run>
            <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NgB7Z9rPXfvRFcsdFjcWdBsSJk_XX_OcbkelrLSc2TI/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NgB7Z9rPXfvRFcsdFjcWdBsSJk_XX_OcbkelrLSc2TI/edit?usp=sharing</run>
          </formatted-text>
